#. type: Title #
#: docs/sap/frontend-exports.md:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Frontend three-tier export convention"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/frontend-exports.md:8
msgid ""
"Embeddable frontend content packs register via **manifest / desktop / "
"mobile** exports."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/frontend-exports.md:10
msgid ""
"The unified settings window is aggregated by the registry in [`packages/"
"shell-ui/`](../../packages/shell-ui/); contract in [`packages/shell-ui/src/"
"settings.ts`](../../packages/shell-ui/src/settings.ts) (unrelated to SAP)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/sap/frontend-exports.md:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manifest (required)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/frontend-exports.md:14
msgid "Path: `./manifest` — JSON-serializable metadata."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/frontend-exports.md:24
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Field             | Description                                         |\n"
"| ----------------- | --------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `appId`           | Application id                                      |\n"
"| `displayName`     | Display name                                        |\n"
"| `version`         | Version (usually synced with monorepo root package) |\n"
"| `supportsDesktop` | Supports desktop embed                              |\n"
"| `supportsMobile`  | Supports mobile embed                               |\n"
"| `connectionKind`  | See table below                                     |\n"
"| `sap`             | Optional; SAP satellites only                       |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/sap/frontend-exports.md:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "connectionKind"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/frontend-exports.md:32
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Value              | Represents                | Sidecar required?                   |\n"
"| ------------------ | ------------------------- | ----------------------------------- |\n"
"| `embedded-sidecar` | companion (VRM + tools)   | **Yes** (embedded in same process)  |\n"
"| `sap-direct`       | chat (renderer → Hub SAP) | **No** (persist `instance_id` only) |\n"
"| `hub-rest`         | Admin console (Hub REST)  | **No**                              |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/frontend-exports.md:34
msgid ""
"Implementation SSOT: [`packages/shell-sdk/src/manifest.ts`](../../packages/"
"shell-sdk/src/manifest.ts)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/sap/frontend-exports.md:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "Desktop / Mobile (optional)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/frontend-exports.md:39
msgid ""
"`./desktop` — desktop shell compile-time import profile (window spec, launch "
"mode)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/frontend-exports.md:39
msgid ""
"`./mobile` — mobile profile; when unsupported, `embedMode: \"unsupported\"`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/frontend-exports.md:41
msgid ""
"`embedMode: \"bundled-spa\"` — UI bundled in client install; Hub provides `/"
"api` and `/sap/v1` only."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/sap/frontend-exports.md:42
#, no-wrap
msgid "Current frontend packages"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/frontend-exports.md:49
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Package                          | appId       | connectionKind     | embedMode     |\n"
"| -------------------------------- | ----------- | ------------------ | ------------- |\n"
"| `@freeanima/satellite-companion` | `companion` | `embedded-sidecar` | sidecar       |\n"
"| `@freeanima/satellite-chat`      | `chat`      | `sap-direct`       | `bundled-spa` |\n"
"| Admin (`app/desktop` profile)    | `admin`     | `hub-rest`         | `bundled-spa` |\n"
msgstr ""

